# model-benchmark-tracker
owner: turbosovth · cadence: daily · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that periodically checks each model's best tokens-per-second across your runs and flags which one is fastest now?**

## Prompt
Compare the current best tok/s per model against the previous run and report any model that has improved or been overtaken, so the TurboFit list stays current.

## Evidence
> which will show the best tokens per second that we've achieved with each one of those.
